namely|PASS: Wood and varnish specify the two materials rather than merely exemplifying a larger list; Vietnamese cụ thể là and punctuation preserve that scope.
temporarily|PASS: Closure during ceiling repairs is limited rather than permanent; translation does not invent a reopening date and participial modification is natural.
wisdom|PASS: Sound judgment through understanding fits uncountable wisdom; calmly settling disagreement is coherent and Vietnamese từng trải is natural in the example.
downtown|REVIEW: [POS_CLASSIFICATION] Central district noun, downtown hotel adjective and went downtown adverb are accurate; North American usage and regional construction identity remain unapproved.
highway|PASS: Major connecting road does not necessarily mean controlled-access motorway; farming-town/port example and quốc lộ are coherent with the stated broad boundary.
